*Within Africa Foundation *

*Oxford Road, Manchester, M12 9PL, UK*

*https://wa-foundation.org
<https://wa-foundation.org>**||**info@wa-foundation.org
<info@wa-foundation.org>*

*06-09-2026*



*Organization/Company: Fairbanks Medical Centre Ltd,*

*RE: QUALIFICATION FOR FUNDING*

*Congratulations!*

Following the completion of *CATEGORY 2 (PROPOSAL) Review Stage*, Within
Africa Foundation (Wa-Foundation) is pleased to inform you that your
project proposal successfully qualified for donation of *USD 45,000.*

*Our review process majorly focused on the following areas;*

=C2=B7       Projects that demonstrate high level of community involvement =
or
partnership

=C2=B7       Accurate financial breakdown of costs involved

=C2=B7       A time frame for implementing the project

=C2=B7       Individuals involved in project implementation

=C2=B7       Project background and clear outcomes

=C2=B7       A clear strategy for financial accountability and project
sustainability

=C2=B7       Alternative sources of income.

We therefore invite you to contact *Online ELT Centre* to help in
establishing the credibility and legitimacy of your organization in
accordance with our policies. This is normally done before funds are
released to avoid funding organizations or companies that do not exist.

After this verification, you will be issued with a *Certificate of
Authenticity*. This Certificate once issued, must be forwarded to us
immediately through our emails; *info@wa-foundation.org*
<info@wa-foundation.org> & *afap3425@gmail.com* <afap3425@gmail.com> in
order for the funds to be released.

*Online ELT Centre* is an award winning partner organization dedicated to
establishing the legitimacy and credibility of African charity
organizations and companies that intend to seek financial support from
Wa-Foundation and many other donors across the globe.

This verification and certification process MUST be done latest,* 9th
September 2026 (Wednesday)*. Since it takes Online ELT Centre between *one
to three days* to complete this activity, we advise that you contact them
early to give them enough time to complete the process before our deadline.

*N/B: Provide the following details while contacting Online ELT Centre for
verification support; *

=C2=B7       The Name of your Organization.

=C2=B7       Country of operation.

=C2=B7       Name and email address of the contact person.

=C2=B7       Letter requesting for verification.

Kindly use the following contact details to reach out to Online ELT Centre
for this process.

*Email them about your request.*

*Website; **https://www.eltcentre.com* <https://www.eltcentre.com>

*Email; **onlineeltcentre@gmail.com* <onlineeltcentre@gmail.com>* and *
*support@eltcentre.com* <support@eltcentre.com>



*Regards,*



Mrs. Kathy Havens,

*Deputy Administrator =E2=80=93 Grants*

*Within Africa Foundation.*

